- Artifact registry to use for plugin bundle distribution (reuse existing internal package registry vs. new bucket).
- Whether `child_process` (vs. `worker_thread`) should be the default now rather than an opt-in, if any of the 5 teams' plugins need native addons or shell-out behavior.
- Signing key management: per-team key pairs vs. a central CI-held signing service.
