Design for a plugin system that five teams build against starting next quarter. Scope: plugin registry, manifest schema, lifecycle hooks, sandboxed execution, versioned API contract, plus the cross-cutting pieces (testing, observability, governance) that make five independent teams shippable without a central bottleneck.

